@startsalt
' Screen: SSO Configuration
' User Stories:
'   - As an org admin, I want to configure SAML or OIDC SSO for my organization
'   - As an org admin, I want to mandate SSO so all members must authenticate via IdP
'   - As an org admin, I want to map IdP groups to org roles
'   - As an org admin, I want a break-glass admin account in case SSO fails

{
  ' Top nav
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Runs | Review Queue | <b>Settings</b>
    .
    <i>Acme Engineering</i> | keith@noizu.com
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Organization Settings — Acme Engineering</b>
  }
  --
  {
    ' Sidebar
    {+
      <b>Settings</b>
      --
      General
      Members
      API Tokens
      <b>SSO</b>
      Freeball
      Webhooks
      Audit Log
    }
    |
    ' Content
    {
      <b>Single Sign-On (SSO)</b>
      ==
      ' Protocol selector
      {+
        <b>SSO Protocol</b>
        --
        (X) <b>SAML 2.0</b>
        ( ) OIDC (OpenID Connect)
        --
        <i>Select the protocol your Identity Provider supports.</i>
      }
      ==
      ' SAML config fields
      {+
        <b>SAML Configuration</b>
        --
        <b>IdP Metadata URL</b>
        "https://idp.acme.com/saml/metadata         "
        <i>Paste your Identity Provider's metadata URL. We'll fetch it automatically.</i>
        --
        <b>ACS URL</b> <i>(read-only — configure this in your IdP)</i>
        "https://app.codefre.sh/auth/saml/acme-engineering/acs"   [Copy]
        --
        <b>Entity ID / Audience</b> <i>(read-only)</i>
        "https://app.codefre.sh/saml/acme-engineering"   [Copy]
        --
        <b>Certificate Fingerprint</b>
        "SHA-256: 4A:B9:2C:E1:7F:3D:88:9A:01:C4:5E:..."   [View Full Cert]
        --
        [Save SAML Config] | [Test SSO Connection]
        <color:green>Last test: 2026-05-10 14:22 UTC — Connection successful</color>
      }
      ==
      ' SSO enforcement
      {+
        <b>SSO Enforcement</b>
        --
        [X] <b>Mandate SSO for all members</b>
        <i>When enabled, all members must authenticate via your IdP.\nPassword-based login is disabled (except break-glass admin).</i>
        --
        <color:orange>Warning: Enforcing SSO before testing may lock out all members.</color>
        --
        [Save Enforcement Setting]
      }
      ==
      ' Role mapping
      {+
        <b>IdP Group → Org Role Mapping</b>
        --
        {#
          <b>IdP Group Attribute Value</b> | <b>Org Role</b> | <b>Actions</b>
          "acme-codefresh-owners          " | ^Owner ^ | [Remove]
          "acme-codefresh-admins          " | ^Admin ^ | [Remove]
          "acme-engineering-all           " | ^Editor^ | [Remove]
        }
        --
        [+ Add Mapping]
        <i>Unmapped users are assigned Viewer role by default.</i>
      }
      ==
      ' Break-glass admin
      {+
        <b>Break-Glass Admin</b>
        --
        <i>A password-authenticated account that bypasses SSO for emergency access.\nStore credentials in your password manager or secrets vault.</i>
        --
        <b>Break-glass email:</b>  keith+breakglass@noizu.com
        <b>Last used:</b>  Never
        --
        [Reset Break-Glass Password] | [View Audit Log for Break-Glass]
      }
    }
  }
}

@endsalt
